OL,3,GNEWSAI moved my shop 20 miles because I
OL,4,Acouldn't afford #300 a week on fuel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAntique shop owner Melanie Wilson says
OL,7,Fshe has moved her business closer to
OL,8,Fhome because she was struggling to pay
OL,9,Fnearly #300 a week on diesel as a
OL,10,Fresult of soaring fuel prices.
OL,12,FShe opened her new location in Turriff,
OL,13,FAberdeenshire, earlier this month -
OL,14,Fcutting her commute by 20 miles and her
OL,15,Ffuel spend in half.
OL,17,FFuel prices in the UK have climbed
OL,18,Fabout 5p in just one week as a result
OL,19,Fof the ongoing conflict in the Middle
OL,20,FEast, with diesel edging towards #1.95
OL,21,Fa litre in some areas.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
