OL,3,GNEWSAI moved my shop 20 miles because I
OL,4,Acouldn't afford #300 a week on fuel
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilson is one of countless people in
OL,7,Fsmall rural locations around Scotland
OL,8,Fwho are feeling the pinch as they need
OL,9,Ftheir cars for work and everyday life.
